# The api image builds from the repository root (it needs agent/nnm-agent.mjs
# to serve to servers being enrolled), so the context is no longer just the
# backend directory. Without this, every build would ship node_modules, the
# git history and the frontend build output into the layer cache.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/node_modules
backend/node_modules
docs
packaging
*.tar.gz
*.log
.env
.env.*
